    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Gamble, Survive, Repeat!</strong> \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Bling Bling Bankruptcy</strong>, a high-stakes gambling adventure where every decision could be your last. Drowning in debt, you have only one way out\u2014bet big, win bigger, and stay ahead of the collectors. But be careful\u2026 one bad day, and it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Play Your Way to Fortune (or Ruin) \ud83c\udccf</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck and skills across a variety of classic and chaotic gambling games:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Poker</strong> \u2013 Outplay your opponents and go all-in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Blackjack</strong> \u2013 Count cards or trust your gut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa1 <strong>Roulette</strong> \u2013 Red or black? Your fate spins in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Plinko</strong> \u2013 Drop and pray for the jackpot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc04 Bet Your Booze</strong> \u2013 Bet on the cow booze.. That's it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Flip the Coin</strong> \u2013 50/50, all or nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Mines</strong> \u2013 Avoid disaster and cash out before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Stock Market</strong> \u2013 Buy low, sell high, or lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598720/extras/ea4b00d20fe60974f5e4c7873bc3e65b.avif?t=1746630373\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Upgrade Your Odds at the Local Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop by the <strong>convenience store</strong> to buy items that boost your chances\u2014lucky charms, energy drinks, or even shady insider tips. Every edge counts when your life is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598720/extras/36bc885555b47ee519c91fbb92b9f991.avif?t=1746630373\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc6 Can You Survive Another Day?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking. Each day, your debt grows. If you can\u2019t pay up, it\u2019s game over. Manage your time, take calculated risks, and climb your way out of financial hell\u2014before the collectors find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 How Far Can You Go?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rogue-like gambling mechanics: every run is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Buy items to enhance your gambling skills and odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A dark yet humorous take on the high-risk world of betting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stylish <strong>pixel art</strong> aesthetic with a gritty casino vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to risk it all? <strong>Play Bling Bling Bankruptcy and roll the dice on your future!</strong> \ud83c\udfb0\ud83d\udd25</p>",
